o GitHub, we need to paste the Google tracking code inside it.</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0">Go to <b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="6">analytics.google.com</b> and sign in with your Gmail account.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0">Click <b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="6">Start Measuring</b> to create a new account. Name it "Free TV Garden."</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,0">When asked to "Choose a platform," select <b data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="42">Web</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,3,0">Enter your new website URL (<code data-path-to-node="4,3,0" data-index-in-node="28">[https://freetvgarden.com](https://freetvgarden.com)</code>) and create a "Data Stream."</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,4,0" id="p-rc_f4b07fa1d4d0f727-19">Google will provide you with a <b data-path-to-node="4,4,0" data-index-in-node="31">Measurement ID</b> (it starts with "G-") and a block of JavaScript code called the <b data-path-to-node="4,4,0" data-index-in-node="110">Google tag</b> (or gtag<span class="citation-25 citation-end-25">.js).<source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2617642329=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2617642329="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="1"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c1431709819="">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1431709819="" _nghost-ng-c1591380249="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1591380249="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1591380249="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from Graphed. Opens side panel." jslog="262206;track:generic_click;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_249173594d555235&quot;,&quot;c_b0031c0bbf9de441&quot;,null,&quot;rc_f4b07fa1d4d0f727&quot;,null,null,