-inline></p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="7"><i data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="0">Now your file is ready to be uploaded to GitHub Pages using the steps we discussed!</i></p><h3 data-path-to-node="8"><span class="citation-20 citation-end-20">Step 3: Set Up Google Search Console (via BigRock)<source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2617642329=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2617642329="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="6"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></h3><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c1431709819="">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1431709819="" _nghost-ng-c1591380249="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1591380249="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1591380249="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="View source details for citation from BigRock. Opens side panel." jslog="262206;track:generic_click;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_249173594d555235&quot;,&quot;c_b0031c0bbf9de441&quot;,null,&quot;rc_f4b07fa1d4d0f727&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[0]]"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1591380249="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c1591380249="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">BigRock</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline><p data-path-to-node="9" id="p-rc_f4b07fa1d4d0f727-24"><span class="citation-19">To prove to Google Search Console that you own </span><code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="47"><span class="citation-19