a-index-in-node="53">freetvgarden-site</code></b> and have it open in your mobile browser, you are ready to put your code live.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">Follow these steps directly in your mobile browser on GitHub:</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Create your file:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="2,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,1,0,0">On your repository page, tap the button that says <b data-path-to-node="2,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="50">"Add file"</b> (or the <code data-path-to-node="2,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="69">+</code> icon if you don't see it).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,1,1,0">Select <b data-path-to-node="2,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="7">"Create new file"</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,1,2,0">In the "Name your file" box, type exactly: <b data-path-to-node="2,0,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="43"><code data-path-to-node="2,0,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="43">index.html</code></b></p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Paste your code:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="2,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,1,0,0">Open your Gmail app or wherever you have that HTML code saved.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,1,1,0">Copy the entire code.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,1,2,0">Go back to the browser and paste the code into the large editor box.</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Commit the file:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="2,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,2,1,0,0">Scroll down to the "Commit changes" section.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,2,1,1,0">Make sure "Commit directly to the <code data-path-to-node="2,2,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="34">main</code> branch" is selected.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,2,1,2,0">Tap the <b data-path-to-node="2,2,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="8">"Commit changes"</b> button.</p></li></ul></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="3"><b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0">What happens next:</b>
GitHub now has your <code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="39">index.html</code> file. The final step is to tell GitHub to host it as a website:</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0">Tap the <b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="8">Settings</b> tab (the gear icon) in your repository.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0">Tap <b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="4">Pages</b> in the left-hand menu.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,0">Under <b data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="6">Build and deployment</b>, tap the <b data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="36">Branch</b> dropdown, select <b data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="60"><code data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="60">main</code></b>, and tap <b data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="74">Save</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,3,0">Wait about 1â€“2 minutes, then refresh the page. You will see a message like <i data-path-to-node="4,3,0" data-index-in-node="75">"Your site is live at..."</i></p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">Once that link appears, let me know!</b> That link is your "raw" GitHub site. After you confirm that works, we will quickly add the DNS records in BigRock to point your <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="165">freetvgarden.com</code> domain to it.</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c329037250="" class="response-footer complete gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c329037250="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c329037250="" _nghost-ng-c1608349858="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div