ointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;What is TV Garden?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;TV Garden is a free live TV streaming platform that lets you watch 1000+ television channels from 200+ countries directly in your web browser. TV Garden provides free access to live news, sports, entertainment, and regional channels worldwide â€” no account or subscription needed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Is TV Garden completely free?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;Yes. TV Garden is 100% free to use. There are no subscription fees, no premium plans, and no payment details required. You can access all channels across all 200+ countries without creating an account or signing in. Simply open the page and start watching instantly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;What happened to TV Garden? Why did it change?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;The original TV Garden website (tv.garden) rebranded to Famelack (famelack.com) in 2026. The same 3D globe interface and channels remain, just under a new name. The TV Garden mobile app was also removed from Google Play in April 2026. TV Garden remains a reliable, fully working alternative providing the same free live TV experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Is TV Garden safe to use?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;Yes, TV Garden is safe. The page does not install any software, does not request personal information, and does not require an account. No personal data is collected. Video streams are embedded from public IPTV sources. tvgarden.odoo.com is hosted on Odoo's secure infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Is TV Garden legal?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;TV Garden embeds publicly available free-to-air IPTV streams and does not host any video content. Many channels are official public or government broadcasters that freely distribute their content online. Streaming laws vary by country and viewers are responsible for complying with laws in their own region.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;How many channels does TV Garden have?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;TV Garden provides access to 1000+ free live TV channels from 200+ countries, including news, sports, entertainment, music, kids, lifestyle, documentary, and regional channels. Some channels may go offline temporarily â€” if one does not load, simply try another from the same country.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Can I watch TV Garden in India?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;Yes, TV Garden works in India. Available Indian channels include DD National, DD News, DD India, DD Sports, Republic Bharat, NDTV India, News18 India, and many regional channels in Hindi, Tamil, Telugu, Malayalam, Kannada, Bengali, and Marathi. No VPN is needed to watch Indian channels from within India.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Can I watch TV Garden in Indonesia?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;Yes. Indonesia is one of the most popular countries on TV Garden. Available channels include TVRI, RCTI, SCTV, Trans TV, Metro TV, Kompas TV, iNews TV, NET., and MNC TV. Select Indonesia from the country list to browse all available Indonesian live TV streams.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Can I watch TV Garden in Bangladesh?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;Yes. TV Garden includes Bangladeshi live TV channels such as BTV, BTV World, Channel i, NTV, Somoy TV, and Jamuna TV. Most channels are freely accessible without a VPN from within Bangladesh.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Can I watch TV Garden in Pakistan?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;Yes. Pakistani channels on TV Garden include PTV National, PTV Home, PTV World, ARY News, Geo News, Hum TV, and Express News. Select Pakistan from the country list to watch live Pakistani television free in your browser.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Can I watch TV Garden in Sri Lanka?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;Yes. Sri Lankan channels on TV Garden include Rupavahini, ITN, Sirasa TV, and Shakthi TV. Select Sri Lanka from the country list. Most channels are accessible free from Sri Lanka without a VPN.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Does TV Garden need a VPN?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;No VPN is required to use TV Garden. The page is accessible globally. Some individual channels may be geo-restricted â€” if a channel does not load, try a free VPN set to that channel's home country. For most channels, no VPN is needed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Does TV Garden have live sports channels?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;Yes. TV Garden includes many free live sports channels including DD Sports (India), TVRI Sport (Indonesia), BTV Sports, PTV Sports (Pakistan), and various public broadcaster sports channels worldwide. Select your country to find available sports channels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Does TV Garden work on mobile phones?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;Yes. TV Garden is fully mobile-friendly on all Android and iPhone devices. Open Chrome (Android) or Safari (iPhone), visit tvgarden.odoo.com, and start watching instantly. Add the page to your home screen to use it like a native app â€” no Play Store or App Store download needed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Why are some TV Garden channels not working?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;Some channels stop working because the IPTV stream URL has expired or is temporarily offline. Try a different channel from the same country. Clear your browser cache (Ctrl+Shift+Delete in Chrome) and reload. Most stream issues resolve within a few hours as streams are updated automatically.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;What internet speed do I need for TV Garden?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;TV Garden live streams work well with a minimum internet speed of 2 Mbps for standard definition and 5 Mbps for HD streams. Standard 4G mobile connections and home broadband are more than sufficient. Close other browser tabs if you experience buffering.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Can I watch international news on TV Garden?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;Yes. TV Garden includes major international free-to-air news channels such as Al Jazeera English, BBC World News, France 24, DW (Deutsche Welle), NHK World Japan, CGTN, and TRT World. These channels are globally available at no cost and stream reliably without a VPN.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Is there a TV Garden app for iOS or Android?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;There is no official TV Garden app on the Google Play Store or Apple App Store. The app was removed in April 2026. The best and safest way is to use TV Garden directly in your browser. On iPhone tap Share â†’ Add to Home Screen. On Android tap menu â†’ Add to Home Screen. It works exactly like an app.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;What is the best TV Garden alternative in 2026?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;Since tv.garden rebranded to Famelack, TV Garden (tvgarden.odoo.com) is the best TV Garden alternative in 2026. It is free, works on all devices without an app, requires no sign-up, and covers 200+ countries with 1000+ live TV channels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Can I watch TV Garden on PC or laptop?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;Yes. TV Garden works on any laptop or desktop using Chrome, Firefox, Edge, or Safari. No software installation needed. Visit tvgarden.odoo.com, click any channel, and press fullscreen. Works on Windows 10, Windows 11, m