an>&gt;</span>Fix:<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span> The stream link for that specific channel may have expired or gone offline. Try clicking a different channel from the same country. Most channels refresh automatically â€” if one does not work, another will. IPTV streams can go offline temporarily; this is normal.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h3</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#d32f2f;margin:0 0 8px;"</span>&gt;</span>âŒ Problem: TV Garden page itself is not loading<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h3</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"color:#333;margin:0;line-height:1.8;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span>Fix:<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span> Clear your browser cache and cookies, then reload the page. In Chrome: press <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span>Ctrl+Shift+Delete<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span> â†’ select "Cached images and files" â†’ Clear data. Then revisit freetvgarden.com.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h3</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#d32f2f;margin:0 0 8px;"</span>&gt;</span>âŒ Problem: TV Garden is geo-blocked in my country<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h3</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"color:#333;margin:0;line-height:1.8;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span>Fix:<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span> Some channels restrict access based on your location. Try using a free VPN (like Windscribe or Proton VPN) set to the channel's home country. Alternatively, choose channels from a different country â€” most international news and regional channels have no geo-restrictions.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">div</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">h3</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#d32f2f;margin:0 0 8px;"</span>&gt;</span>âŒ Problem: Video is buffering or very slow<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">h3</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"color:#333;margin:0;line-height:1.8;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span>Fix:<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">strong</span>&gt;</span> This is usually a 