 â€” no account or subscription needed.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>Is TV Garden completely free?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>Yes. TV Garden is 100% free to use. There are no subscription fees, no premium plans, and no payment details required. You can access all channels across all 200+ countries without creating an account or signing in. Simply open the page and start watching instantly.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>What happened to TV Garden? Why did it change?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>The original TV Garden website (tv.garden) rebranded to Famelack (famelack.com) in 2026. The same 3D globe interface and channels remain, just under a new name. The TV Garden mobile app was also removed from Google Play in April 2026. TV Garden remains a reliable, fully working alternative providing the same free live TV experience.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>Is TV Garden safe to use?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>Yes, TV Garden is safe. The page does not install any software, does not request personal information, and does not require an account. No personal data is collected. Video streams are embedded from public IPTV sources.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>Is TV Garden legal?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>TV Garden embeds publicly available free-to-air IPTV streams and does not host any video content. Many channels are official public or government broadcasters that freely distribute their content online. Streaming laws vary by country and viewers are responsible for complying with laws in their own region.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>How many channels does TV Garden have?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>TV Garden provides access to 1000+ free live TV channels from 200+ countries, including news, sports, entertainment, music, kids, lifestyle, documentary, and regional channels. Some channels may go offline temporarily â€” if one does not load, simply try another from the same country.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>Can I watch TV Garden in India?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>Yes, TV Garden works in India. Available Indian channels include DD National, DD News, DD India, DD Sports, Republic Bharat, NDTV India, News18 India, and many regional channels in Hindi, Tamil, Telugu, Malayalam, Kannada, Bengali, and Marathi. No VPN is needed to watch Indian channels from within India.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>Can I watch TV Garden in Indonesia?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>Yes. Indonesia is one of the most popular countries on TV Garden. Available channels include TVRI, RCTI, SCTV, Trans TV, Metro TV, Kompas TV, iNews TV, NET., and MNC TV. Select Indonesia from the country list to browse all available Indonesian live TV streams.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>Can I watch TV Garden in Bangladesh?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>Yes. TV Garden includes Bangladeshi live TV channels such as BTV, BTV World, Channel i, NTV, Somoy TV, and Jamuna TV. Most channels are freely accessible without a VPN from within Bangladesh.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>Can I watch TV Garden in Pakistan?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>Yes. Pakistani channels on TV Garden include PTV National, PTV Home, PTV World, ARY News, Geo News, Hum TV, and Express News. Select Pakistan from the country list to watch live Pakistani television free in your browser.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>Can I watch TV Garden in Sri Lanka?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>Yes. Sri Lankan channels on TV Garden include Rupavahini, ITN, Sirasa TV, and Shakthi TV. Select Sri Lanka from the country list. Most channels are accessible free from Sri Lanka without a VPN.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>Does TV Garden need a VPN?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>No VPN is required to use TV Garden. The page is accessible globally. Some individual channels may be geo-restricted â€” if a channel does not load, try a free VPN set to that channel's home country. For most channels, no VPN is needed.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>Does TV Garden have live sports channels?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>Yes. TV Garden includes many free live sports channels including DD Sports (India), TVRI Sport (Indonesia), BTV Sports, PTV Sports (Pakistan), and various public broadcaster sports channels worldwide. Select your country to find available sports channels.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>Does TV Garden work on mobile phones?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>Yes. TV Garden is fully mobile-friendly on all Android and iPhone devices. Open Chrome (Android) or Safari (iPhone), visit freetvgarden.com, and start watching instantly. Add the page to your home screen to use it like a native app â€” no Play Store or App Store download needed.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>Why are some TV Garden channels not working?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>Some channels stop working because the IPTV stream URL has expired or is temporarily offline. Try a different channel from the same country. Clear your browser cache (Ctrl+Shift+Delete in Chrome) and reload. Most stream issues resolve within a few hours as streams are updated automatically.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>What internet speed do I need for TV Garden?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>TV Garden live streams work well with a minimum internet speed of 2 Mbps for standard definition and 5 Mbps for HD streams. Standard 4G mobile connections and home broadband are more than sufficient. Close other browser tabs if you experience buffering.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>Can I watch international news on TV Garden?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>Yes. TV Garden includes major international free-to-air news channels such as Al Jazeera English, BBC World News, France 24, DW (Deutsche Welle), NHK World Japan, CGTN, and TRT World. These channels are globally available at no cost and stream reliably without a VPN.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>Is there a TV Garden app for iOS or Android?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>There is no official TV Garden app on the Google Play Store or Apple App Store. The app was removed in April 2026. The best and safest way is to use TV Garden directly in your browser. On iPhone tap Share â†’ Add to Home Screen. On Android tap menu â†’ Add to Home Screen. It works exactly like an app.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>What is the best TV Garden alternative in 2026?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>Since tv.garden rebranded to Famelack, TV Garden (freetvgarden.com) is the best TV Garden alternative in 2026. It is free, works on all devices without an app, requires no sign-up, and covers 200+ countries with 1000+ live TV channels.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">details</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">summary</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"</span>&gt;</span>Can I watch TV Garden on PC or laptop?<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">summary</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">p</span> <span class="hljs-attr">style</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"</span>&gt;</span>Yes. TV Garden works on any laptop or desktop using Chrome, Firefox, Edge, or Safari. No software installation needed. Visit freetvgarden.com, click any channel, and press fullscreen. Works on Windows 10, Windows 11, macOS, and Linux.<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">p</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">details</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">div</span>&gt;</span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">section</span>&gt;</span>

<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">body</span>&gt;</span>
