</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="4">Next Steps:</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="5"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,0">Copy this entire block of code above.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,0">Go back to your GitHub repository in your browser.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,2,0">Paste it directly into your <code data-path-to-node="5,2,0" data-index-in-node="28">index.html</code> file and commit the changes.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,3,0">Give GitHub Pages a minute or two to rebuild.</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="6">Once you check <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="15">freetvgarden.com</code> in your browser and it's live, your Google Analytics dashboard will start recording real-time visitors immediately! Let me know if you run into any formatting issues when you paste it.</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c329037250="" class="response-footer complete gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c329037250="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c329037250="" _nghost-ng-c1608349858="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></