&lt;div style="background: #ffffff; color: #111;"&gt;
    &lt;div style="max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 18px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;box-sizing:border-box;"&gt;&lt;h1 style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin:0 0 10px;"&gt;TV Garden: Watch Live Television Around the Globe&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:15px;color:#555;margin:0 0 24px;line-height:1.6;"&gt;Experience the world through the eyes of locals. TV Garden is an interactive map that lets you tune into 1000+ live television channels from 200+ countries. Just like spinning a globe, you can navigate from London to Tokyo, watching news, sports, music, and culture in real-time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin:0 0 10px;"&gt;ðŸ“º How it works:&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:15px;color:#555;margin:0 0 24px;line-height:1.6;"&gt;The map is populated with 1000+ channels across 200+ countries. Click on any city to instantly load the local TV station. It's the perfect tool for language learners, travelers, and anyone curious about global media.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin:0 0 16px;"&gt;ðŸŒ What Can You Watch?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul style="list-style-type:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 32px;"&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size:15px;color:#111;display:block;margin-bottom:4px;"&gt;ðŸ“° Live News&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.6;"&gt;See breaking news events unfolding live from local perspectives in Ukraine, Brazil, or India.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size:15px;color:#111;display:block;margin-bottom:4px;"&gt;ðŸŽµ Music Videos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.6;"&gt;Discover local hits on 24/7 music channels in South Korea, Jamaica, or Spain.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size:15px;color:#111;display:block;margin-bottom:4px;"&gt;ðŸŽ¥ Local Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;color:#555;line-height:1.6;"&gt;Watch documentaries, cooking shows, and variety programs unique to specific regions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin:0 0 16px;"&gt;â“ Frequently Asked Questions&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;details style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:9px;padding:15px 17px;margin-bottom:9px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:#111;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;â–¶&lt;/span&gt; Is this free to use?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:14px;color:#4B5563;margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.7;"&gt;Yes! TV Garden aggregates Free-to-Air (FTA) channels that are publicly available on the internet. You do not need a subscription.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:9px;padding:15px 17px;margin-bottom:9px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:#111;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;â–¶&lt;/span&gt; Why do some channels load slowly?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:14px;color:#4B5563;margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.7;"&gt;You are connecting directly to servers located in other countries. If you are watching a channel in Australia from the USA, the signal has to travel halfway around the world, which may cause buffering.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:9px;padding:15px 17px;margin-bottom:9px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:#111;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;â–¶&lt;/span&gt; Can I watch sports?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:14px;color:#4B5563;margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.7;"&gt;Some channels broadcast local sports, but major premium events (like the Premier League or NFL) are usually encrypted and not available on free public streams.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;div style="max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 18px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;box-sizing:border-box;"&gt;&lt;hr style="border:none;border-top:2px solid #f0f0f0;margin:40px 0;"/&gt;&lt;h2 style="font-size:21px;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin:0 0 6px;"&gt;ðŸ“¡ Free Live TV Channels by Country&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:15px;color:#555;margin:0 0 22px;line-height:1.6;"&gt;TV Garden streams 1000+ live television channels from 200+ countries. Here are popular channels available from major English-speaking countries:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-bottom:44px;"&gt;&lt;div style="background:#f0f7ff;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:4px solid #2563EB;"&gt;&lt;h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#1e3a5f;"&gt;ðŸ‡ºðŸ‡¸ United States&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul style="margin:0;padding-left:16px;color:#374151;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;"&gt;&lt;li&gt;ABC News Live&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;NBC News Now&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;CBS News 24/7&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;PBS America&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fox Weather&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:13px;color:#6B7280;margin:10px 0 0;line-height:1.5;"&gt;Watch live American news and entertainment â€” no cable needed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="background:#fff5f5;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:4px solid #DC2626;"&gt;&lt;h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#5f1e1e;"&gt;ðŸ‡¬ðŸ‡§ United Kingdom&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul style="margin:0;padding-left:16px;color:#374151;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;"&gt;&lt;li&gt;BBC News&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sky News&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;GB News&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;ITV News&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Channel 4 News&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:13px;color:#6B7280;margin:10px 0 0;line-height:1.5;"&gt;Access BBC and Sky News live from anywhere in the world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:4px solid #16A34A;"&gt;&lt;h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#1a4731;"&gt;ðŸ‡¨ðŸ‡¦ Canada&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul style="margin:0;padding-left:16px;color:#374151;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;"&gt;&lt;li&gt;CBC News&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;CTV News&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Global News&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;CP24&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;City TV&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:13px;color:#6B7280;margin:10px 0 0;line-height:1.5;"&gt;Stream Canadian TV channels including CBC and CTV free.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="background:#fffbeb;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:4px solid #D97706;"&gt;&lt;h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#5f3d0a;"&gt;ðŸ‡¦ðŸ‡º Australia&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul style="margin:0;padding-left:16px;color:#374151;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;"&gt;&lt;li&gt;ABC News Australia&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sky News Australia&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;9News&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;7News&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;SBS World News&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:13px;color:#6B7280;margin:10px 0 0;line-height:1.5;"&gt;Watch Australian television including ABC and 9News online free.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 style="font-size:21px;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin:0 0 16px;"&gt;â“ More Frequently Asked Questions&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;details style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:9px;padding:15px 17px;margin-bottom:9px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:#111;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;â–¶&lt;/span&gt; Can I watch US channels like ABC, NBC, or CBS for free?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:14px;color:#4B5563;margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.7;"&gt;Yes. TV Garden aggregates publicly available live streams from the United States including major news networks. Navigate the interactive map to any US city â€” New York, Los Angeles, or Chicago â€” to access local American broadcast channels for free, without a cable subscription.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:9px;padding:15px 17px;margin-bottom:9px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:#111;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;â–¶&lt;/span&gt; Can I watch BBC or Sky News free from outside the UK?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:14px;color:#4B5563;margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.7;"&gt;TV Garden includes UK-based channels that stream publicly without geo-restrictions. BBC News International, Sky News, and GB News are commonly accessible. Select cities like London or Manchester on the map to find UK channels available in your region.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:9px;padding:15px 17px;margin-bottom:9px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:#111;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;â–¶&lt;/span&gt; Does TV Garden work in the United States?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:14px;color:#4B5563;margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.7;"&gt;Yes. TV Garden works on any device with a modern web browser â€” no app download, no VPN, and no paid subscription required. Viewers in the US, UK, Canada, and Australia can access both local and international channels instantly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:9px;padding:15px 17px;margin-bottom:9px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:#111;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;â–¶&lt;/span&gt; Is there a TV Garden app for iPhone or Android?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:14px;color:#4B5563;margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.7;"&gt;No app download is needed. TV Garden is fully mobile-optimised and works directly in Safari, Chrome, or Firefox on your iPhone or Android. Just open the page and start watching instantly â€” no installation required.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:9px;padding:15px 17px;margin-bottom:9px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:#111;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;â–¶&lt;/span&gt; Do I need an account to watch live TV?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:14px;color:#4B5563;margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.7;"&gt;No account or sign-up is needed. TV Garden is completely free. There are no paywalls, no email requirements, and no hidden fees â€” just open the page and start watching live television from around the world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:9px;padding:15px 17px;margin-bottom:9px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:#111;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;â–¶&lt;/span&gt; What is the difference between TV Garden and Netflix?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:14px;color:#4B5563;margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.7;"&gt;TV Garden is a live television aggregator, not a video-on-demand service. Unlike Netflix or Disney+, TV Garden streams actual real-time broadcast television from stations around the world. It is ideal for live news, live sports, and local culture programming â€” all completely free with no subscription.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:9px;padding:15px 17px;margin-bottom:9px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:#111;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;â–¶&lt;/span&gt; Can I watch live sports on TV Garden?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="font-size:14px;color:#4B5563;margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.7;"&gt;Yes. M