    &lt;section style="padding:40px 20px;margin:30px 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"&gt;&lt;h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:6px;"&gt;â“ TV Garden â€” Frequently Asked Questions (2026)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="color:#666;margin-bottom:28px;font-size:1rem;"&gt;Everything you need to know about watching free live TV with TV Garden.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;What is TV Garden?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;TV Garden is a free live TV streaming platform that lets you watch 1000+ television channels from 200+ countries directly in your web browser. TV Garden provides free access to live news, sports, entertainment, and regional channels worldwide â€” no account or subscription needed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;Is TV Garden completely free?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;Yes. TV Garden is 100% free to use. There are no subscription fees, no premium plans, and no payment details required. You can access all channels across all 200+ countries without creating an account or signing in. Simply open the page and start watching instantly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&lt;details style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;"&gt;&lt;summary style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;list-style:none;"&gt;What happened to TV Garden? Why did it change?&lt;/summary&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#333;"&gt;The original TV Garden website (tv.garden) rebranded